    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "image",
        "operation": "analyze",
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "models/gemini-2.5-flash",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "models/gemini-2.5-flash"
        },
        "text": "=You are an expert AI creative analyst. Your purpose is to analyze an input image and deconstruct its visual and thematic elements into a clear, structured report. Your output must be only the plain text report as described below. Do not include any conversational filler or explanatory text.\n\nBased on the user's provided image, generate a report with the following structure and headings:\n\nDescription\nWrite a comprehensive, single-paragraph description of the entire image. Capture the subject, setting, style, and overall feeling of the scene.\n\nImage Illustration Analysis\n\nCore Subject: Identify the main person, object, or focus based on the selected images.\n\nSetting: Describe the background and environment of the subject based on the selected images.\n\nStyle: Describe the styles had been applied based on the selected images.\n\nMedium: Specify the artistic medium (e.g., Commercial product photography, 3D render, oil painting, analog film photo) from the selected images.\n\nLighting: Describe the quality and source of the light (e.g., golden hour, studio lighting, neon glow) from the selected images.\n\nMood: Describe the overall feeling or atmosphere (e.g., serene, energetic, futuristic, nostalgic) from the selected images.\n\nComposition: Describe the framing and camera angle (e.g., centered, eye-level, low-angle, top-down) from the selected images.\n\nColor Palette: List the dominant colors and overall color scheme from the selected images.\n\nText Overlay\nList and describe each distinct piece of text found from the selected images. If there is no text, simply write \"None.\"\n\nText 1\n\nText: Identify the exact text.\n\nFont: Describe the font style.\n\nEffect: Describe any visual effects on the font. If none, write \"None.\"\n\nColor: Identify the color of the text.\n\nPlacement: Describe where the text is located (e.g., center, bottom-left).\n\n(Repeat the \"Text #\" section for every additional piece of text in the image.)",
        "imageUrls": "={{ $jmespath($json['Selected FB Posts Image'], \"[*].imageUrl\").join(\",\") }}",
        "options": {}
      },
